      "writtenOn": "2020-03-09T14:23:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the script is being called from Soong (indirectly) and is going to be run in Android CI, this should be changed to $OUT_DIR. OUT_DIR can be override by setting in the build command line (as seen here: https://cs.corp.google.com/piper///depot/google3/configs/wireless/android/busytown/platform/git_qt/git_qt-release.gcl?q\u003dOUT_DIR+busytown\u0026sq\u003dpackage:piper+file://depot/google3+-file:google3/experimental\u0026dr\u003dC\u0026l\u003d2667) in the Android CI.\n\nYou can check if OUT_DIR is set first. If it is not, you can set it to \"out\" by default. You should test this by running \n\nOUT_DIR\u003d\"/tmp/try\" lunch\nOUT_DIR\u003d\"/tmp/try\" m",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 17,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 17,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "a983ea07cf80a312ea20811143d8447332d66586",
