      "writtenOn": "2020-03-09T20:04:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This script will not run from within soong. To add a similar feature to soong, golang would be a better choice. It\u0027s not clear to me that adding a query language to soong makes sense at this time.\n\nThis is a quick and dirty way to leverage what\u0027s already available in ninja to use as a tool alongside soong. Basically, it is good enough to get done what I need now until a better option comes along.",
      "parentUuid": "51ba290f_81cdffde",
